    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥφαιστος</span></b>  (
			Aeol.
		and 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄφ-</span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἅφ-</span></b> ) <i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			66
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>O.</u>
			7.35
		</span></i>, etc.), ὁ, <u>Hephaestus</u>,
			<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			18.391
		</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον Ἡφαίστοιο</span>, of
		a bowl, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			4.617
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημῖδας ὀρειχάλκοιο . . Ἡφαίστου
					κλυτὰ δῶρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					123
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὶ Ἡφαίστοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.88
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰ τὸν Ἥ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					17.35D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <u>Volcanus</u>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.276b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.49
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			= Egypt. <u>Plah</u>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				90.2
			</span></i> (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> name for <i>nine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theol.Ar.
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> meton. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>, <i>fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.426
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				123
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				1007
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.315
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.74
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
